Action layouts: CC0 1.0 Universal

The action layouts in this folder are dedicated to the public domain under the Creative Commons
CC0 1.0 Universal dedication. The full legal code is at
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

By submitting a layout to this folder you dedicate it to the public domain under CC0 1.0, to the
extent the law allows you to. A layout is a program's keyboard shortcuts laid out on tabs, with
names and short descriptions. Anyone may copy, change and use it for any purpose, including folding
it into the action packs Loungepad ships, without asking and without credit.

This notice covers the actions/ folder only. It does not cover the themes and extensions elsewhere
in this repository.
